1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,733 --> 00:00:45,973
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:48,320
=Episode 18=

4
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,079
Imperial Physician!

5
00:00:49,679 --> 00:00:50,880
Summon the imperial physician!

6
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,679
Wanniang.

7
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:55,560
Please stop crying.

8
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,039
The imperial physician said
you mustn't grieve.

9
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,880
This is Che's baby and mine.

10
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:05,240
I promised you

11
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,320
I'd protect the baby.

12
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,760
Your Majesty.

13
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,159
Concubine Hui.

14
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:21,959
You're still young.

15
00:01:22,239 --> 00:01:23,879
You can have another child.

16
00:01:24,239 --> 00:01:25,760
What matters now

17
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,480
is for you to recover.

18
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,200
Try not to grieve too much.

19
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,000
Your Majesty.

20
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:34,400
Your Majesty.

21
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:36,159
Someone laced the candlewick

22
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,519
with an aphrodisiac.

23
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,439
Once you inhaled the fumes,

24
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,079
you lost control.

25
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,120
After Consort Shu died,

26
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,760
one of her former maids

27
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,439
was reassigned to Jiyun Pavilion.

28
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,719
Somehow, she heard rumors

29
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:48,879
and became convinced

30
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,319
Concubine Hui killed Consort Shu,

31
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:53,120
so she sought revenge.

32
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,439
She's already been brought here.

33
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,159
Bring her in.

34
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:04,799
(How is that possible?)

35
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,680
(But I told Xiahe to kill her.)

36
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,039
Since Consort Chen sent you to do this,

37
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,919
she never meant to let you live.

38
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,560
The moment you leave Jiyun Pavilion,

39
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:25,960
someone will follow

40
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,400
and kill you.

41
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,719
If you don't believe me,

42
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,560
go ahead and walk out.

43
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,080
If you want to live,

44
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:35,719
come with me.

45
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,240
Your Highness.

46
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:48,560
Xiahe is missing.

47
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,199
Spare me, Your Majesty!

48
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:53,639
Spare me, Concubine Hui!

49
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,240
I...

50
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:58,560
Consort Chen ordered me to do it.

51
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:00,439
You wretched maid!

52
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,639
What nonsense are you talking about?

53
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,080
Consort Chen

54
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,919
told me to put the drug in the candle.

55
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,960
She said once it was lit,

56
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,479
His Majesty would be overcome by desire
and lose control.

57
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:14,039
She also told me to flee in the chaos

58
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,319
and leave behind a confession

59
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:19,599
blaming everything on Consort Shu.

60
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:20,879
This...

61
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:23,240
This is the reward Consort Chen gave me.

62
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,719
Consort Chen.

63
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,240
Since I entered the palace,

64
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:42,280
I've always deferred to you

65
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:44,159
and never dared compete with you.

66
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,879
Why did you harm my unborn child?

67
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,759
That child was His Majesty's too.

68
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,039
Your Majesty.

69
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,159
I... I lost my head for a moment.

70
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:56,919
Your Majesty.

71
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:57,599
I didn't mean to.

72
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,039
You monster!

73
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,199
Why did you do this?

74
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,280
Your Majesty.

75
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,159
You once told me

76
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,400
that in this palace,

77
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:07,960
aside from my sister,

78
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,000
I was the only woman you loved.

79
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,400
But now

80
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:14,159
you've given those words and that love

81
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,159
to someone else.

82
00:04:16,159 --> 00:04:17,280
How could I not hate her?

83
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,280
Enough!

84
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,680
Your Majesty.

85
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,879
Will you really cast aside

86
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,319
the bond we've shared all these years
for her?

87
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,439
Our bond?

88
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:32,120
You're cruel and vicious.

89
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,800
You tried to kill my child.

90
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:36,839
And you still dare speak of our bond?

91
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,040
Guards!

92
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,519
Confine Consort Chen to Chenghua Palace.

93
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:41,680
Without my permission,

94
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,959
she is not to set foot outside.

95
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:43,879
Your Majesty!

96
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,240
As for the others,

97
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,600
Concubine Hui will deal with them.

98
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:48,879
Yes.

99
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,959
Your Majesty!

100
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,360
Your Majesty!

101
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:06,760
(Treasures of Heaven and Earth)

102
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:08,279
She tried to kill the Emperor's child

103
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,839
and was only confined.

104
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,240
It seems

105
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,519
Consort Chen was spared

106
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,879
because her uncle, General Zhang Heng,

107
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:17,680
has repeatedly distinguished himself.

108
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,560
The head of the Zhang family died young.

109
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,560
The Zhang clan's main branch
was already small.

110
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,720
Empress Roujia,

111
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,600
mindful that
she and Consort Chen shared a father,

112
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:27,519
asked His Majesty to give Zhang Heng

113
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,959
a post in the army.

114
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,759
His Majesty loved Roujia deeply.

115
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,839
Out of affection for her,

116
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,680
he gave Zhang Heng a chance to rise.

117
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,319
Over the years on the northern frontier,

118
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,680
he has won battle after battle

119
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,759
and has earned great military renown.

120
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:41,600
His soldiers answer to General Zhang,

121
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,839
not the Emperor.

122
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,160
(His achievements eclipse the Emperor.)

123
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:49,759
It's getting late.

124
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,000
You should head back.

125
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,079
Be careful.

126
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:53,920
Don't arouse suspicion.

127
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:54,920
Take care.

128
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:00,879
Wanniang.

129
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:02,839
The maid who drugged the candle

130
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,480
has been released as you ordered,

131
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,560
under a suitable pretext.

132
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:10,279
Good. As long as she's gone.

133
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:13,279
Consort Chen has Zhang Heng backing her.

134
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,800
His Majesty won't punish her further.

135
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:17,000
Are we supposed to just endure this?

136
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:17,839
I...

137
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:20,040
I can't accept that.

138
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,360
Do you remember

139
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,879
the craftsmen who

140
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,480
built Guizhen Cottage years ago

141
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,199
and all died suddenly?

142
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,399
I do.

143
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,279
They called it an epidemic.

144
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,600
The officials hastily buried them
and left it at that.

145
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,160
There was one person

146
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,920
we can't ignore in that case:

147
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:42,279
Vice Director Shen of the
Construction Bureau, Ministry of Works.

148
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,279
Vice Director Shen?

149
00:06:45,079 --> 00:06:46,399
Wasn't he...

150
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,319
Consort Chen's uncle by marriage?

151
00:06:51,399 --> 00:06:53,040
Zhang Heng's achievements
eclipse the Emperor.

152
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,120
Consort Chen abuses her power
and kills at will.

153
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,319
Vice Director Shen embezzles funds
and takes bribes.

154
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:01,120
With all of that piling up,

155
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,519
even if His Majesty

156
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,399
keeps pretending not to see it,

157
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,079
he'll have to face it.

158
00:07:23,009 --> 00:07:27,196
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

159
00:07:27,330 --> 00:07:30,943
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

160
00:07:31,178 --> 00:07:33,777
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

161
00:07:33,814 --> 00:07:36,094
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

162
00:07:36,141 --> 00:07:39,970
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

163
00:07:40,372 --> 00:07:43,725
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

164
00:07:44,652 --> 00:07:48,165
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

165
00:07:48,665 --> 00:07:51,232
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

166
00:07:51,358 --> 00:07:53,391
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

167
00:07:53,458 --> 00:07:57,235
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

168
00:07:57,585 --> 00:08:01,918
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

169
00:08:02,141 --> 00:08:05,648
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

170
00:08:05,829 --> 00:08:08,682
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

171
00:08:08,749 --> 00:08:14,363
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

172
00:08:14,403 --> 00:08:17,417
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

173
00:08:17,458 --> 00:08:23,466
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

174
00:08:24,133 --> 00:08:31,088
♪The past has faded away♪

175
00:08:31,088 --> 00:08:35,120
♪The past has faded away♪
